  "title": {
   "en": "Neko o Shohou Itashimasu."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "猫を処方いたします。"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Neko wo Shoho Itashimasu."
   },
   {
    "en": "We'll Prescribe You a Cat."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In Kyoto, there is a certain questionable-looking mental health clinic. Nike-sensei is a mysterious, enthusiastic doctor who works there, and he prescribes... cats!\nThe \"prescription cats\" will heal the hearts and minds of patients who are having problems with work and interpersonal relationships. Also, this clinic has its own mystery...\n\nA heartwarming and \"nyanderful\" story! This is a manga adaptation of a very popular novel that has exceeded 200,000 copies sold.\n\n(Source: Comic-Days)",
   "ja": "京都にある怪しげなメンタルクリニック。不思議なノリの医者、ニケ先生が処方してくれるのは…猫！仕事や人間関係に悩みを抱えた患者さんたちの心を、個性豊かな「処方猫」達が癒していく。そしてこの病院には謎があって――。心温まるニャンダフルストーリー！シリーズ累計20万部突破の大人気小説をコミカライズ。"
  },
